Valnes WebLock app allows you to open doors over the net.

Download the Valnes WebLock app if you own a Valnes WebLock or if you have received an invitation to use a Valnes WebLock.

Delegation of access to users is done via management console (https://login.valnes.ee).

Features:
• Sign up a user;
• Open doors via internet;
• Insert app keys to gain access to doors;
• Ability to monitor the current door state (open/closed) assuming that hall sensor or door sensor is installed. 

Read more about the features on www.valnes.com

My Silknet App is created to simplify your account management. Application’s user friendly and easy interface enables you to:

- Check and top up your balance;
- Purchase Meti, Cosmo, Silkfest, Internet, voice and SMS bundles;
- Activate / deactivate various tariffs and services;
- Automatically refill balance on your or others’ accounts;
- Check your fixed account services;
- View News and current campaigns from Silknet.

The new application is available on iOS operation system, requires iOS 12 or later.
